{"id":"1d11f892f3efc814","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-top2-locally-compact-space.md","title":"ZFC Top2 Locally Compact Space","display":"df-zfc-top2-locally-compact-space — ZFC Top2 Locally Compact Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top2-locally-compact-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top2-locally-compact-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top2-locally-compact-space — ZFC Top2 Locally Compact Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top2-locally-compact-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top2-locally-compact-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top2-locally-compact-space — ZFC Top2 Locally Compact Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"67cf48a2f6e27861\" href=\"?note=67cf48a2f6e27861\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset\">58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\)</span> (compact-subset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"67cf48a2f6e27861\" href=\"?note=67cf48a2f6e27861\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset\">58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2LocallyCompactSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2LocallyCompactSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}locally\\text{-}compact\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2LocallyCompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists K\\subseteq X\\;(x\\in U\\land U\\subseteq K\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,X,\\tau))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}locally\\text{-}compact\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2LocallyCompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists K\\subseteq X\\;(x\\in U\\land U\\subseteq K\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,X,\\tau))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every point has an open neighbourhood contained in a compact subset, i.e. a compact neighbourhood in the non-Hausdorff-neutral convention.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset","status":"resolved","id":"67cf48a2f6e27861","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset","status":"resolved","id":"67cf48a2f6e27861","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S$ (compact-subset predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2LocallyCompactSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}locally\\text{-}compact\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2LocallyCompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists K\\subseteq X\\;(x\\in U\\land U\\subseteq K\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,X,\\tau))","display":true}],"